!**/.codewhale/constitution.json
.deepseek/
HANDOFF.md

# Node.js dev dependencies (root package.json: pinned jsdom for
# browser_extension/tools/smoke_*.mjs). The lockfile IS committed — see
# .github/workflows/README.md.
node_modules/

# Browser extension signing key (determines the fixed extension ID)
keys/

# Local diagnostic logs copied out of the browser
log/

# Development roadmap (local only, not published)
/Plan.md
.vscode

# MSVC intermediate files from browser_extension/native_host/build_bridge.bat.
# That script invokes cl.exe with its CWD set to the repository root (the
# POST_BUILD step passes only the output dir), so the .obj — and the .pdb / .exe
# cl writes next to it — land in the working tree rather than under build/.
# Without these patterns a "git add -A" happily commits compiler output.
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
/easypass_native_host.exe


